abstract: >-
  Synthetic-only interactive actuarial-economic companion demonstrating
  finite-horizon repair-versus-replace service-continuity calculations
  for two hypothetical vehicle cohorts. Source code is MIT licensed;
  original documentation and synthetic diagrams are CC BY 4.0;
  Brilliance Bridge trademarks and branding remain reserved.
  No proprietary warranty provider data, model rankings or empirical
  lifetime LTROI estimates are included.
keywords:
  - actuarial science
  - reliability engineering
  - synthetic modelling
  - automotive economics
  - finite horizon optimisation
